5. **Payloads (5)**: Interacts with Power (2), Communication (3), and On-Board Computer (6).
6. **On-Board Computer (6)**: Manages interactions with all subsystems except itself.

The interaction matrix is represented as a 6x6 binary matrix where rows represent the source component and columns represent the destination component. A value of 1 indicates an interaction, and 0 indicates no interaction.

